        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>古代汉语(下)习题(汇总版) - 第二章 古书的注解</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" defer></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #e5e5e5;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .phone {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #fff;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n  }\n  /* status bar */\n  .statusbar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 6px 16px 2px 16px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .statusbar .icons { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n  /* nav bar */\n  .navbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 6px 12px 10px 12px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\n  }\n  .navbar .back {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    width: 30px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .navbar .titlewrap {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .navbar .title {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .navbar .subicon {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #999;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .navbar .done {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 3px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #333;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .navbar .done .icon {\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .content {\n    padding: 10px 16px 40px 16px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n  }\n  h1.chapter {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 4px 0 14px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  h2.section {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 16px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .q {\n    margin: 10px 0;\n  }\n  .opts {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 4px 18px;\n    margin: 2px 0 2px 14px;\n  }\n  .opts span {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .subline {\n    margin: 2px 0 2px 14px;\n  }\n  .blank {\n    display: inline-block;\n    min-width: 42px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    height: 1em;\n    vertical-align: bottom;\n    margin: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .fillq {\n    margin: 8px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"phone\">\n\n  <div class=\"statusbar\">\n    <div class=\"time\">14:36</div>\n    <div class=\"date\">5月20日周六</div>\n    <div class=\"icons\">\n      <span>🕐</span>\n      <span>66% 🔋</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"navbar\">\n    <div class=\"back\">☰</div>\n    <div class=\"titlewrap\">\n      <span class=\"title\">古代汉语(下)习题(汇总版)</span>\n      <span class=\"subicon\">▾</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"done\"><span class=\"icon\">📤</span> 完成</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <h1 class=\"chapter\">第二章　古书的注解</h1>\n\n    <h2 class=\"section\">一、选择题</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      1.《说文·户部》：\"户，护也\"属于（　　）。\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A.形训</span><span>B.义训</span><span>C.声训</span><span>D.递训</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      2.学时习之，不亦说乎？（《论语·学而》）朱熹《注》：\"学\"（　　）'效'也。人性皆善而觉有先后。\"在括号中填入合适的术语。\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A.谓</span><span>B.谓之</span><span>C.之言</span><span>D.为</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      3.《论语·季氏》：\"吾恐季孙之忧，不在颛臾，而在萧墙之内也。\"郑玄注：\"萧之言肃也。\"术语\"之言\"作是（　　）。\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A.注音</span><span>B.释义</span><span>C.说明通假</span><span>D.注音兼释义</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      4.伟之蚩虫，抱布贸丝。（《诗经·卫风·氓》）毛传《氓，民也。蚩蚩，敦厚。（　　）在括号中填入正确的注解术语。\n      <div class=\"opts\">\n        <span>A.犹</span><span>B.谓之</span><span>C.之貌</span><span>D.读若</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      5.《孟子·梁惠王上》：\"老吾老以及人之老，幼吾幼以及人之幼。\"赵岐注：\"老，敬敬也；幼，敬爱也。\"下列对其中注释术语描述正确的一项是（　　）。\n      <div class=\"subline\">A.释词或释义的语句，说明被释词语表示的性质或状态。</div>\n      <div class=\"subline\">B.被解词与注释词之间意义相近，大体相当于现代汉语的\"等于\"或\"等于\"</div>\n      <div class=\"subline\">C.一般用本字来说明通假字，点明通假现象。</div>\n      <div class=\"subline\">D.用被读音相同或相近的词来注释。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      6.按照古注类别前后层次的联系，下列古注排序正确的是（　　）。\n      <div class=\"subline\">A.传——集解——疏　　B.传——笺——集解——疏</div>\n      <div class=\"subline\">B.传——集解——疏——笺　　D.疏——笺——传——集解</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      7.下列属于孔颖达《五经正义》的是（　　）。（多选）\n      <div class=\"subline\">A.《周易正义》　　B.《尚书正义》　　C.《毛诗正义》</div>\n      <div class=\"subline\">D.《礼记正义》　　E.《春秋左传正义》</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"q\">\n      8.下列关于\"谓之\"的用法表述正确的是（　　）。（多选）\n      <div class=\"subline\">A.被解释的词都放在术语的后面　　B.可译作\"叫\"、\"叫做\"等</div>\n      <div class=\"subline\">C.被解释的词的部放在术语的前面　　D.能用来辨析近义词、同义词</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"section\">二、填空题</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"fillq\">1.\"说文四大家\"是指：<span class=\"blank\"></span>、<span class=\"blank\"></span>、<span class=\"blank\"></span>、<span class=\"blank\"></span>。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"fillq\">2.古代注释产生于<span class=\"blank\"></span>，兴盛于<span class=\"blank\"></span>，发展于魏晋魏晋至隋唐，变化于<span class=\"blank\"></span>，复兴于<span class=\"blank\"></span>。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"fillq\">3.毛亨对《诗经》的注解，称为<span class=\"blank\"></span>，简称为<span class=\"blank\"></span>。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"fillq\">4.郑玄对《毛传》隐晦简略的地方，郑氏加以阐明，另一方面把不同于《毛传》的意见写出来，以表示有别于已有的注解，称为<span class=\"blank\"></span>。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"fillq\">5.到隋唐时代，\"小学\"领域包括了文字学、<span class=\"blank\"></span>、<span class=\"blank\"></span>三部分。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"fillq\">6.末端是代代著者的注解家，著有<span class=\"blank\"></span>、《诗集传》<span class=\"blank\"></span>。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"fillq\">7.古籍在传抄刻中误抄的字，叫作<span class=\"blank\"></span>，简称<span class=\"blank\"></span>，而古籍在传抄刻中漏抄的字，叫作<span class=\"blank\"></span>，简称<span class=\"blank\"></span>。[illegible]</div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
